Kleber.

00:46:24.910 --> 00:46:25.510
O Kleber.

00:46:25.770 --> 00:46:27.150
Klebinho, ele chama de Klebinho.

00:46:27.170 --> 00:46:28.070
Chamei de Klebinho.

